// Title: Potential Persistence Via GlobalFlags
// ID: 36803969-5421-41ec-b92f-8500f79c23b0
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Karneades, Jonhnathan Ribeiro, Florian Roth
// Date: 2018-04-11
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1546.012, car.2013-01-002
// Description: Detects registry persistence technique using the GlobalFlags and SilentProcessExit keys
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(TargetObject ICONTAINS "\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\") AND where(TargetObject ICONTAINS "\\Image File Execution Options\\") AND where(TargetObject ICONTAINS "\\GlobalFlag"))) OR ((where(TargetObject ICONTAINS "\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\") AND where(TargetObject ICONTAINS "\\SilentProcessExit\\")) AND (where(TargetObject ICONTAINS "\\ReportingMode") OR where(TargetObject ICONTAINS "\\MonitorProcess"))))
